      "title": "Krea V9 Full Showcase Notes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Krea V9 full showcase workflow\n\nThis workflow demonstrates five reference roles:\n1. Content anchor: keep the same subject.\n2. Visual style: suggest the visual style.\n3. Material texture: suggest material or texture.\n4. Manual lighting/mood: manual tuning with lighting and shadows.\n5. Text/logo guard: avoid copying text/logos with gentle prompt handling.\n\nBefore queueing, copy example_assets/krea-reference-examples into your ComfyUI input folder so the Load Image paths resolve as krea-reference-examples/*.png, or replace the Load Image nodes with your own test images.\n\nThe package supports up to 12 guide cards; this example uses five so the graph stays readable while exercising quick recipes, manual tuning, prompt strength, smart timing, and text/logo guard handling."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
